== otpauth URIs
otpauth://totp/ACME%20Co:john@example.com?secret=JBSWY3DPEHPK3PXP&issuer=ACME%20Co
  -> issuer "ACME Co" account "john@example.com" secret JBSWY3DPEHPK3PXP SHA1/6/30
  -> otpauth://totp/ACME%20Co:john%40example.com?secret=JBSWY3DPEHPK3PXP&issuer=ACME%20Co&algorithm=SHA1&digits=6&period=30
otpauth://totp/Label:me?secret=jbswy3dpehpk3pxp&issuer=Param
  -> issuer "Param" account "me" secret JBSWY3DPEHPK3PXP SHA1/6/30
  -> otpauth://totp/Param:me?secret=JBSWY3DPEHPK3PXP&issuer=Param&algorithm=SHA1&digits=6&period=30
otpauth://totp/Label:me?secret=JBSWY3DPEHPK3PXP%3D%3D%3D%3D
  -> issuer "Label" account "me" secret JBSWY3DPEHPK3PXP SHA1/6/30
  -> otpauth://totp/Label:me?secret=JBSWY3DPEHPK3PXP&issuer=Label&algorithm=SHA1&digits=6&period=30
otpauth://totp/me?secret=JBSWY3DPEHPK3PXP&algorithm=sha256&digits=8&period=60&foo=bar
  -> issuer "" account "me" secret JBSWY3DPEHPK3PXP SHA256/8/60
  -> otpauth://totp/me?secret=JBSWY3DPEHPK3PXP&algorithm=SHA256&digits=8&period=60
otpauth://hotp/me?secret=JBSWY3DPEHPK3PXP&counter=1
  refused: only otpauth://totp/ URIs are kept
otpauth://totp/me?secret=JBSWY3DPEHPK3PXP&digits=9
  refused: digits is 6 to 8
otpauth://totp/me?secret=JBSWY3DPEHPK3PXP&algorithm=MD5
  refused: unknown algorithm
otpauth://totp/me?secret=
  refused: the secret is missing
otpauth://totp/?secret=JBSWY3DPEHPK3PXP
  refused: issuer and account are empty
otpauth://totp/me?secret=JBSWY3DPEHPK3PX1
  refused: the secret is not base32
OTPAUTH://TOTP/me?secret=JBSWY3DPEHPK3PXP
  -> issuer "" account "me" secret JBSWY3DPEHPK3PXP SHA1/6/30
  -> otpauth://totp/me?secret=JBSWY3DPEHPK3PXP&algorithm=SHA1&digits=6&period=30
