a refusal holds no part of a URI's seed: true

== bare secrets
"GitHub" "me" "jbsw y3dp ehpk 3pxp" -> JBSWY3DPEHPK3PXP otpauth://totp/GitHub:me?secret=JBSWY3DPEHPK3PXP&issuer=GitHub&algorithm=SHA1&digits=6&period=30
"GitHub" "" "JBSWY3DPEHPK3PXP====" -> JBSWY3DPEHPK3PXP otpauth://totp/GitHub:?secret=JBSWY3DPEHPK3PXP&issuer=GitHub&algorithm=SHA1&digits=6&period=30
"" "" "JBSWY3DPEHPK3PXP" -> refused: issuer and account are empty
"GitHub" "me" "not base32!" -> refused: the secret is not base32
"GitHub" "me" "" -> refused: the secret is missing
the bare secret and its URI give one record: true
export then add reproduces "A & B" "x:y z": true
export then add reproduces "A:B" "me": true
export then add reproduces "" "a:b": true
export then add reproduces "" "plain": true

