== grouped fold
one record, no copy
  nothing to do
two renames: the newer labels win, at the id
  move aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa (conflicted copy from laptop) -> aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa
the newer one is already at the id
  remove aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa (conflicted copy from laptop)
a tie on modified: the bytewise greatest
  move aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa (conflicted copy from laptop) -> aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa
another seed survives at its digest id
  move aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa (conflicted copy from laptop) -> e592527539efbdc84c0b4e3570def5fb
no file at the id: the newest group takes it
  move aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa (conflicted copy 2 from laptop) -> aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa
  move aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa (conflicted copy from laptop) -> 3310cf52b9e54133322dd6a6573c6e39
the file at the id does not open: kept, every group to its digest
  remove aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa (conflicted copy 2 from laptop)
  move aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa (conflicted copy from laptop) -> 23310437f044516fd53c27b286329338
a copy that does not open is left
  nothing to do
a leaf that is no record id is ignored
  nothing to do
folding the result again does nothing: true

== keyring fold
each added a slot: the union
  write keyring {"keyId":"0123456789abcdef","slots":[{"id":"1111111111111111","kind":"later"},{"id":"2222222222222222","kind":"later"}]}
  remove keyring (conflicted copy from laptop)
the copy adds nothing: removed
  remove keyring (conflicted copy from laptop)
another key id: left and reported
  left keyring (conflicted copy from laptop)
no copy
  nothing to do
